Test medium only (4fbbefd614b x64 Debug); never select in Configure.
Record the submission and driver completion of each FAT32 mirror child in
fixed nonpaged memory. Sample one 512-byte FAT sector at submit (the sector
containing cluster 39907). No per-write printing, on-disk log or control
device. At shutdown hold the test VM for up to 90 seconds after the volume
loop so the host can read the closed table from saved RAM. Observation can
change timing; the samples are not a checksum of the device's final DMA.

